          "Use launch templates and versioned machine images for consistent instances.",
          "Configure health checks against an application endpoint that reflects readiness.",
          "Set scaling policies based on suitable workload signals and capacity limits."
        ],
        productionConsiderations: [
          "Set realistic health-check thresholds and grace periods.",
          "Keep application sessions external or use carefully designed session affinity.",
          "Use instance refresh or a controlled deployment process for launch template changes.",
          "Test scale-out capacity, startup time and dependency connection limits."
