        ],
        productionConsiderations: [
          "Define subscription ownership and quota escalation processes.",
          "Use policy initiatives to enforce required security and compliance settings.",
          "Avoid using resource groups as if they were network isolation boundaries.",
          "Document regional dependencies and the impact of regional service limitations."
        ],
