          "Grant application identities only the database and storage permissions they require.",
          "Configure backup retention, point-in-time recovery options and lifecycle policies.",
          "Store credentials and sensitive configuration in Secret Manager rather than source code.",
          "Test restore procedures and validate application compatibility after recovery."
        ],
        productionConsiderations: [
          "Define RPO and RTO for every critical dataset and test them through restore exercises.",
          "Review database connection limits, pooling, query latency and storage growth.",
          "Avoid assuming that object versioning alone is a complete backup strategy.",
          "Use retention and deletion controls appropriate to compliance and business requirements.",
          "Monitor replication lag, backup failures and storage lifecycle behavior."
