      "Manage data ownership, replication, consistency and residency requirements.",
      "Build deployment, observability, cost management and recovery processes across providers."
    ],
    diagram: [
      "Global users resolve application endpoints through health-aware DNS and traffic steering.",
      "Federated identity and security controls govern access to provider-specific resources.",
      "Private connectivity or approved encrypted paths connect cloud environments.",
