        productionConsiderations: [
          "Do not assume two different database products provide identical transaction or consistency behavior.",
          "Measure replication lag against the business RPO.",
          "Control data egress and cross-region transfer costs.",
          "Prevent split-brain writes by defining which environment can accept authoritative updates during recovery."
